{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34804","headline":"淅上 二 · 司空图","name":"淅上 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西北乡关近帝京，烟尘一片正伤情。\n愁看地色连空色，静听歌声似哭声。\n红蓼满邨人不在，青山遶槛路难平。\n从他烟棹更南去，休向津头问去程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}